          "title": "Fractions",
          "body": "Equivalent fractions represent the same quantity. Simplify a fraction by dividing numerator and\ndenominator by a common factor. For example, 18/24 = 3/4.\nTo add or subtract fractions with different denominators, first express them with a common\ndenominator. Example: 2/3 + 1/4 = 8/12 + 3/12 = 11/12."
        }
